OL,3,GNEWSAReviving a 200-year-old ale recipe
OL,4,Amade in a teapot
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve Holton, owner of Kirkstall
OL,7,FBrewery in Leeds, found the
OL,8,Fleather-bound brewery ledger containing
OL,9,Fthe recipe and teamed up with Allsopp's
OL,10,Fdescendent Jamie Allsopp to remake what
OL,11,Fthey called "one of the most important
OL,12,Fbeers in brewing history."
